WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.006
Welcome to H R officer training for SaloneHCM.

2
00:00:03.006 --> 00:00:09.954
Your work keeps every record accurate — and accurate records are what make payroll, compliance, and audits painless.

3
00:00:09.954 --> 00:00:15.226
We'll cover the employee register, leave management, attendance, and the document vault.

4
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.484
The employee register is your single source of truth.

5
00:00:19.484 --> 00:00:24.671
Every person's grade, salary, bank details, NASSIT number, and department lives here.

6
00:00:24.671 --> 00:00:35.594
Use the search bar to find anyone instantly, and the add employee button to onboard a new hire — the form guides you through every required field, including statutory identifiers.

7
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:43.427
Next, leave. Employees request leave from their self-service portal, and those requests arrive here for your approval.

8
00:00:43.427 --> 00:00:50.482
You can see balances, overlapping dates, and the team calendar before you decide — so cover gaps never surprise you.

9
00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:59.499
Attendance gives you the daily picture: who clocked in, who's absent, and the timesheet totals feeding into payroll.

10
00:00:59.499 --> 00:01:05.186
Records can be corrected by H R when a device fails — and every correction is audit logged.

11
00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:16.086
Finally, the document vault. Contracts, identity documents, disciplinary letters — uploaded once, stored securely in the cloud, and scoped to your organisation.

12
00:01:16.086 --> 00:01:20.266
Use the search and category filters to retrieve anything in seconds.

13
00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:26.701
Remember: clean employee data today prevents payroll disputes tomorrow.

14
00:01:26.701 --> 00:01:32.594
When you're ready, take the H R officer quiz in the Training Center and earn your certificate.
